sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor STAFF
    participant OTS as 🖥️ Station OTS (Multiple)
    participant CAT as ⚙️ Catapult Server
    participant POS as 💳 POS
    actor CASHIER
    participant KDS as 🍳 KDS / Printer

    %% -----------------------------
    %% TABLE AVAILABILITY CHECK
    %% -----------------------------
    Note over OTS: User selects table & creates order
    STAFF->>OTS: Create table transaction
    OTS->>CAT: [POST] api/pos/v1/table/check\n(table_id)

    alt Table NOT Available
        CAT-->>OTS: Response: NOT AVAILABLE
        Note over OTS: ❌ Show prompt: "Table occupied"\nStop transaction
    else Table Available
        CAT-->>OTS: Response: AVAILABLE

        %% -----------------------------
        %% ORDER CREATION
        %% -----------------------------        
        OTS->>CAT: [POST] api/station-ots/v1/transaction/store
        CAT->>CAT: Process transaction
        Note right of CAT: 🗄️ INSERT → station_terminal_transaction\nstatus: PENDING

        %% -----------------------------
        %% BROADCAST EVENT
        %% -----------------------------
        Note over CAT: 📡 Pusher: Broadcast Events
        CAT-->>POS: [EVENT] TransactionEvent

        %% -----------------------------
        %% POS HANDLING
        %% -----------------------------
        POS->>POS: Process transaction
        Note right of POS: 🗄️ INSERT → POS DB\nstatus: OPEN

        %% -----------------------------
        %% KITCHEN HANDLING
        %% -----------------------------
        Note over POS: Auto send back receive data to Catapult to process Kitchen
        POS->>CAT: [POST] api/pos/v1/transaction/store
        CAT->>CAT: Process transaction to KDS 
        Note over CAT: 📡 Pusher: Broadcast Events
        CAT-->>KDS: [EVENT] KDSTransactionEvent
        
        %% -----------------------------
        %% KDS / PRINTER HANDLING
        %% -----------------------------
        KDS->>KDS: Display order on screen
        KDS->>KDS: Print receipt (thermal)

        %% -----------------------------
        %% SETTLEMENT HANDLING
        %% -----------------------------
        %%Note over CAT,POS: 🟢 POS TO CATAPULT MANUAL INTERACTION STARTS HERE
        Note over POS: Cashier settles order
        CASHIER->>POS: Settle the transaction
        POS->>CAT: [POST] api/pos/v1/transaction/store (with SETTLE indetifier)

        %% -----------------------------
        %% FINALIZATION
        %% -----------------------------
        CAT->>CAT: Process settled transaction
        Note right of CAT: 🗄️ INSERT → cdis_terminal_transaction\nstatus: SETTLED
        Note right of CAT: 🗑️ DELETE → station_terminal_transaction

        %% -----------------------------
        %% NOTIFICATION BACK
        %% -----------------------------
        Note over CAT: 📡 Pusher: Broadcast Events
        CAT-->>OTS: [EVENT] OTSTransactionEvent (SETTLED)
    end